OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrests after man
OL,4,Ashot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man aged 20 and a sixteen-year-old
OL,7,Fboy have been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fattempted murder after man in his 40s
OL,9,Fwas shot.
OL,11,FIt was reported that suspects fired at
OL,12,Fa house on Balmer Hill, in Gainford,
OL,13,Fnear Darlington, at about 20:10 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday, and then left.
OL,16,FA 46-year-old man is in a critical but
OL,17,Fstable condition after suffering
OL,18,Fbirdshot injuries to his abdomen.
OL,20,FDurham Police said no one else at the
OL,21,Faddress was injured and officers
OL,22,Fremained at the scene.
